At \(x{=}0\),

**19.17.4**: \(W(a,0){=}\frac{1}{2^{i}}\bigl{|}\frac{\Gamma(\frac{1}{4}{+}\frac{1}{2^{i}}a)}{ \Gamma(\frac{3}{4}{+}\frac{1}{2^{i}}a)}\bigr{|}^{i}{=}\frac{1}{2^{i}}\sqrt{ \frac{G_{1}}{G_{3}}}\)
